From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|monge}}, {{m|roa-opt|monje}}, a {{bor|pt|pro|monge|nocap=1}}, from {{der|pt|VL.|*monicus}}, from {{der|pt|ML.}}, {{der|pt|LL.|monachus}}, from {{der|pt|grc|μοναχός||single, solitary}}, from {{m|grc|μόνος||alone}}. Displaced {{etyl|roa-opt|-}} {{m|roa-opt|moogo}}. Compare {{etyl|gl|-}} {{m|gl|monxe}} and {{etyl|es|-}} {{m|es|monje}}.

